 Tag Copy, Convert shn. Row 3: setlist.fm upgrade, As-Is Artist Name, Tag Copy/Delete Original, Dry run. Row 4 begins with Thorough Setlist Matching; the remaining cells are unused. Thorough Setlist Matching defaults off. The setlist.fm upgrade checkbox is directly beneath setlist.fm and has effect only while setlist.fm is enabled. Compliant and Rename Compliantly are mutually exclusive: checking either one automatically unchecks the other.}
