12. Tagging functions}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af12\afs20\alang1033 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af2\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\cf0\f2\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af10\langfe1033\sl276\slmult1{\loch
The tagging window is used when you want TLO to write tags to audio files. Its title bar uses the installed application version (v1.6 Build 456 in this manual). Inside the window, the single bold heading is Traders Little Helper\u8482\'99 Tagger App; there is no second in-window version heading. The exact layout may vary slightly by platform, but the main choices and actions are the same.}
